    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f538a664818b9766bbde5b3e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要有训练员在，涡轮的\r\n引擎就能超越极限超完全燃烧！\r\n两个人在一起就无敌了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c22ce29c71d6e0fc79ea4e561a197dbd6eaab1cd49d5a0a8e4bb08eae89d3241",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c784a74256a3dd296e3f1e75",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ターボいってくる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c821d5783baa5f41f02a52e1119ca16b91469c293a42a03effcbe6e5b3adb51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "100000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/100000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ce92b8074ee71e4ca47c63e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ただいまー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c76249a685fb9f9750702a9bec77a0f48bf5677e31f292201a7e3458e4d45b92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "100001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/100001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:442daf8fac876602f60d9d76",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要有训练员陪着啊！\r\n涡轮就能开心奔跑！开心变强！\r\n然后开心拿下胜利呢！根本是最强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f13d2a0937d1edec3cfcbb75ab3ff44d563324601ad48344916266accbef276",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36a22f1fd2a81e44ac0ad621",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要训练员露出笑容啊，\r\n涡轮也会很高兴哦！\r\n一直在一起就有最强的开心啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d48c2db7a67e4b6b48faeb0113db6d5840d570ac294e659cc7b2d5563281fad8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0462811517134e772d5f1eb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不断地捣麻糬，捣啊捣啊捣啊！\r\n就完成超厉害的麻糬了！\r\n可以拉得跟涡轮的身高差不多长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ae0ca599ae19bda6bb064765ab834b340cd92123549de74ae2f1b9e8699ef37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca51f7f19f5616660d064e4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只有咖啡色或黑色太无趣了！所以\r\n我加了果冻、腌渍红姜和灯泡装饰，\r\n做成色彩缤纷的超甜巧克力啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9723d8e7d300bf0f7b96224525c00206dd8266366f17a45240a4e2a1b6074ed8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c235a4a3937e988a6711ccdc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "送你这个最强的超苦巧克力！\r\n这是涡轮到处去找才总算找到的哦！\r\n是最适合成熟的训练员的口味！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a7cf00b120b4f0c473d8352d756d982b8391a08c45734082376dd7167477aa9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef98983b1c6268690eea0a6b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "绑在竹子上的签纸啊，\r\n五颜六色的很漂亮对吧！\r\n如果会闪闪发光的话就更棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a121c592d0ca0dcc6b3aa9284a6e3f71420cd8f5498f907efc90c3aad5dc9f7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:096431f63512480422f3b3e9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要给涡轮彩色的点心？\r\n还是要被涡轮涂成彩色的！？\r\n训练员选一个吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf3354a261e7ff235c7fbaf479a68a8bdbff7ed71d3459989aa25fc2d2d1085a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6b2288451903f0b28a915ae",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "灯饰很棒对吧！如果圣诞老人\r\n也把雪橇弄得亮晶晶的话，\r\n就更容易发现他了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ea5edd337285994da6183b5500d2f6b91832bba88a8eb2c4e2026bb525f811",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72b26a36153cefbe98024dda",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果没有收到圣诞老人的礼物\r\n就跟涡轮说吧！\r\n涡轮每年都有收到，可以分给你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "223f515bfdbae12eda1aca6b54b156ee66959d1e4b0876d0db61a917916b343a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91c4ca1289202454567e1028",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好强好厉害！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2975259f05b9c60ee50d1c1c3e6fbeae5ce338ad09640875c748005a4f1f5f01",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "1001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/1001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38c7b393ed9df2376b794110",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然涡轮很讨厌大扫除！\r\n但擦地板比赛会让人热血沸腾哦！\r\n我们都是在菱亚没注意时举办呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bae549a15ee40e0f290a60acfa26d4444a1ce1b7b51ca37450fd1c264aac7c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38495689ed90e608689d31f7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "生日快乐～！\r\n我们会举办派对对吧！?\r\n涡轮要吃点心！很多的点心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f9691ff3ee69dcd157e019ead035b15d128a5a5b8911e0d02d52155538b06e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ecfbc3e710b839baf27ded4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "涡轮做了一部庆祝生日的影片哦！\r\n影片内容是涡轮发射七彩的光束，\r\n在天空写上「助你升日快乐」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cefa0b0d12fcd695b80ed88d87af8a52d33821b38e669930239182cd42dba00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88920d3029034cfc2df7b681",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们家在吃生日蛋糕的时候啊！\r\n会用鲜奶油或巧克力米装饰上\r\n与涡轮岁数相同颜色的数量哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1556f4452d20d0b78c06e74b48ed2d26cdecefa04a5cfc376b6e446ac0e323e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe83c5e602eccb0e0bec1c14",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "涡轮过生日了～！\r\n欸欸！我们来举办游戏大赛吧！\r\n边吃蛋糕边玩游戏到睡着为止！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f76f3b5ffc01c0a920c4f8e748f7e26278369025b9f40474b11e58966b52a8ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a473ec247ee72ec0ccf03a15",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是公告！收到公告啰！\r\n我们快点去看看嘛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d00375468f7fa68b8a1bbefdd25142fd4f2ad79073afcf5b81e45e1178a97ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:431e63bbea5745b61ede9f75",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好像收到礼物了耶～！\r\n欸，快点打开啦！快点嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6a99bdf82aebd4b28b0ba2718f43185fdebf57ed6be1f217146aebc6869b0d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a161616d5ff237c64c50b3e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "达成任务了耶！\r\n记得要确实收下报酬哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6a6f45ecfb162fc8d5bee21abfb0363fe9f218fe6434efca34910d823102cc5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1066/10017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a223c2d54515609eb68e5f9a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听说活动好像开始了！\r\n训练员会参加对吧！对吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "924564b84316448989ac1a514fb859687629941713a5f910dc9d2758b08e18ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
